	desc: <<<DESC
Migrated from Semgrep rule `hooks-stop-missing-active-check-generic` (/tmp/semgrep-rules/ai/ai-best-practices/hooks-stop-missing-active-check/hooks-stop-missing-active-check.yaml).
Original message: Stop hook outputs a "block" decision. Ensure you check stop_hook_active first and exit 0 if true, otherwise the hook will cause an infinite loop by blocking its own stop attempts.

CWE: CWE-835: Loop with Unreachable Exit Condition
References:
- https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/hooks
- https://cursor.com/docs/agent/hooks
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
Review the flagged code and follow the framework's secure coding guidance: use safe APIs, escape output, and avoid hardcoded credentials.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.sh": <<<POS
"decision"#8<l8v"<6F"block"

POS
	"safefile://neg.sample": <<<NEG
# safe sample
no secrets here
just regular code
NEG
)

${*.sh}.pattern_regex(/"decision".*"block"/) as $p0
${*.bash}.pattern_regex(/"decision".*"block"/) as $p1
$p0 + $p1 as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Hooks Stop Missing Active Check Generic",
	title_zh: "检测到Hooks Stop Missing Active Check Generic",
	message: "Hooks Stop Missing Active Check Generic",
